OL,3,GNEWSAThe forgotten sea tragedy which
OL,4,Akilled hundreds
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn a dark, bleak winter evening in
OL,7,FVictorian Kent, a tragedy at sea meant
OL,8,Fhundreds of people bound for a new life
OL,9,Fnever reached their destination.
OL,11,FThe story of how the Northfleet, an
OL,12,Femigrant ship bound for Australia, sank
OL,13,Foff the coast of Dungeness was seen as
OL,14,Fa maritime tragedy by many, killing
OL,15,Fnearly 300 people after the boat was
OL,16,Fhit by a steamship which sailed off
OL,17,Finto the night.
OL,19,FBut despite an outpouring of support,
OL,20,Fincluding from Queen Victoria, the
OL,21,Fstory of the Northfleet is one that is
OL,22,Fnot so well remembered.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
